{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/Green.gif?t=1746516436\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Orbs Orbs Orbs</strong> is a vibrant 2D precision clicker game. Clear the board by clicking to create a white ring that destroys the orbs. Unlock six distinct orb types across 55 levels\u2014each with its own physics movement.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Orb Types:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Green</strong> \u2013 The balanced all-rounder</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blue</strong> \u2013 Large and slow-moving#</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Teal</strong> \u2013 Small, light, and nimble</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Orange</strong> \u2013 Floats with reversed gravity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Red</strong> \u2013 Unpredictable and chaotic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pink</strong> \u2013 Creates new orbs on collision</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every orb behaves differently, creating endless combinations of movement and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/Orange.gif?t=1746516436\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Puzzle Elements &amp; Mechanics:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Seesaws and moving platforms add to the challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Red zones destroy your white ring, and certain areas can't be clicked on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Destructible green blocks can alter your approach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Attraction and repelling zones manipulate the orbs movement</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll need quick thinking, clever timing, and a little bit of chaos control to clear each board!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/TightSpace.gif?t=1746516436\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Relaxing &amp; Chaotic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With soothing ASMR-inspired sound effects and colourful, physics-based interactions, <i>Orbs Orbs Orbs</i> delivers a unique mix of relaxation and energetic puzzle-solving. Levels can be calming or wildly unpredictable depending on how many orbs are in play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play Again:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your score is based on the number of attempts needed to clear the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must secure at least two orbs to progress\u2014but aiming for three is the ultimate challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Track your personal best time and score </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're looking for a casual, meditative experience or a high-score buzz, <i>Orbs Orbs Orbs</i> will keep you clicking, strategizing, and coming back for more!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623400?t=1746516436","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623400?t=1746516436","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/7cfd88ac26f0355bed5a6816573bb81aa5ca571e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746516436","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/7cfd88ac26f0355bed5a6816573bb81aa5ca571e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746516436","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3699930,"descrip