l to clear each board!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/extras/TightSpace.gif?t=1746516436\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Relaxing &amp; Chaotic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With soothing ASMR-inspired sound effects and colourful, physics-based interactions, <i>Orbs Orbs Orbs</i> delivers a unique mix of relaxation and energetic puzzle-solving. Levels can be calming or wildly unpredictable depending on how many orbs are in play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play Again:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your score is based on the number of attempts needed to clear the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must secure at least two orbs to progress\u2014but aiming for three is the ultimate challenge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Track your personal best time and score </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're looking for a casual, meditative experience or a high-score buzz, <i>Orbs Orbs Orbs</i> will keep you clicking, strategizing, and coming back for more!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Acrylic Pixel Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623400/0f1b22917f055611ca0410192ee43c8fbca32874/header.jpg?t=1746516436","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131763,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131763/movie480.mp4?t=1745768196","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131763/movie_max.mp4?t=1745768196"},"name":"Example Level","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131763/1f6364abc08070034bdb7e17357f02e59b200796/movie_600x337.jpg?t